{
    "title": "Logo Quiz:Guess Brand Game",
    "description": "Logo Quiz is a free guessing logo game\r\nWe deal with well-known brands every day, the clothes we wear, the drinks we drink, the cars we use to travel, our mobile phones, computers, and more.\r\nYou must know more or less well-known brands from all over the world, in this game, you will see their logos, do you remember their names? Let's take a guess at these logos.\r\n\r\nGameplay:\r\n\u2022 Observe the logos in the levels\r\n\u2022 Click on the letter below to spell its name\r\n\u2022 You can also use props when encountering difficulties\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n\u2022 Very fun and easy to learn\r\n\u2022 1800+ brand logos, constantly updated!\r\n\u2022 Different difficulty, giving you different options\r\n\r\nInvite your friends to play Logo Quiz and see who knows more brands!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Logo Quiz is a free guessing logo game<br>We deal with well-known brands every day, the clothes we wear, the drinks we drink, the cars we use to travel, our mobile phones, computers, and more.<br>You must know more or less well-known brands from all over the world, in this game, you will see their logos, do you remember their names? Let&#39;s take a guess at these logos.<br><br>Gameplay:<br>\u2022 Observe the logos in the levels<br>\u2022 Click on the letter below to spell its name<br>\u2022 You can also use props when encountering difficulties<br><br>Game Features:<br>\u2022 Very fun and easy to learn<br>\u2022 1800+ brand logos, constantly updated!<br>\u2022 Different difficulty, giving you different options<br><br>Invite your friends to play Logo Quiz and see who knows more brands!",
